==Battleground==
*6 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Calamary|Calamaries]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 146.67~150 seconds<sup>4,400f~4,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 173.33 seconds<sup>5,200f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 240 seconds<sup>7,200f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spawn [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Time Traveller Cats]] and a few [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cats]] at the start to hold off the Mr. Angels. Then use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to take out the first Calamary before the Winged Pigge arrives. Lure it to your base and use Ramen and Time Traveller to kill it. If everything goes according to plan you will be able to rush down the base with a second Bahamut before the next Calamary and Winged Pigge spawn.

==Trivia==
*Every single enemy here has the [[Weaken|weaken]] ability.

